Looking at this problem, I need to count squares in a binary matrix. There are two types:
1. Axis-aligned squares (sides parallel to matrix edges)
2. Diagonal squares (sides parallel to diagonals)

A valid square must have a frame of 1s and not have any adjacent 1s (foreign 1s touching by side or corner).

